-- STORYLINE BOARD SYSTEM (from dump: StorylineBoardService)
-- Boards: WhaleIslandTown, CrimsonCamp, Farm, BlickCastle,
--         Mines, WhaleIslandBeach, DeepForest, Swamp, VolcanicArea
-- Each has an NPC gatekeeper + ProximityPrompt on the board
